ORDER CONFIRMATION

Hi <%= @user.name || @user.email.split("@").first.capitalize %>,

Great news! Your order has been successfully created and is being processed.

ORDER DETAILS
==============

Order ID: #<%= @order.id %>
Status: <%= @order.status.humanize %>
Order Date: <%= @order.created_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p") %>

ITEMS ORDERED
=============

<% @order_items.each do |item| %>
<%= item.product.name %>
Quantity: <%= item.quantity %>
Price: $<%= number_to_currency(item.unit_price, unit: "") %>
Subtotal: $<%= number_to_currency(item.unit_price * item.quantity, unit: "") %>
---
<% end %>

Total Items: <%= @total_items %>
TOTAL: $<%= number_to_currency(@order.total_amount, unit: "") %>

We'll keep you updated on your order status. You can track your order by logging into your account.

Thank you for your business!

The Eco Team
